  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento del Ministerio de R. E., Comercio Internacional y Culto II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the Ministry of Foreign Relations, International Trade and Worship II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es fortalecer el desempeo institucional del Ministerio de Relaciones Exteriores, Comercio Internacional y Culto (MRECIC) en las reas de gestin operativa, promocin comercial y atraccin de inversiones, a fin de contribuir a una mayor participacin de las Pequeas y Medianas Empresas (PyMES) en las actividades de comercio internacional.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to improve the institutional performance of the MRECIC in the areas of operational management, trade promotion, and attraction of investments, to help increase participation by small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in foreign trade activities.</narrative>
  </description>
